# Source-distribution contents (SEC-13).
#
# setuptools' default sdist file list includes `tests/`, so published sdists
# carried all 29 test modules — and `check_package_data.py` could not see them
# until it started canonicalizing every sdist member rather than only the
# `skillsmgr/` ones. The suite is developed and run from the repository (and
# from the released wheel's own verification job), never from an sdist, so it is
# pruned here. `tests/` is also on that gate's must-never-ship list.
prune tests
